WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.296
Welcome to Mage Card Game. Players sign in with Google, Apple, or email.

00:06.200 --> 00:13.552
After signing in, you arrive in the Arena. You can host a match, join a friend's match, or play against the computer.

00:14.467 --> 00:18.643
Tap Play versus AI, then pick an opponent. We choose Emberlord.

00:19.567 --> 00:24.784
Both players start with 20 health. To win, bring your opponent's health to zero.

00:25.700 --> 00:30.396
Diamonds go into the Mine, which gives energy. We play the 8 of Diamonds.

00:31.300 --> 00:36.776
Kings, Queens and Jacks are Royals. We spend energy to summon the Jack of Diamonds.

00:37.700 --> 00:40.904
Now the AI takes its turn. It summons a King.

00:42.500 --> 00:43.434
Then a Queen.

00:44.367 --> 00:50.259
Our turn. Spades make a Royal stronger. We pick the 10 of Spades, then tap our Jack.

00:56.667 --> 00:59.785
Our Jack now has 11 attack and 11 defense.

01:00.700 --> 01:04.579
To attack, tap Attack, pick a Royal, and confirm.

01:08.100 --> 01:11.482
Now the AI decides whether to block with one of its Royals.

01:12.400 --> 01:20.672
It blocked with its Queen, so the two Royals fought a duel. The result box shows it: our Jack was stronger, and the Queen was destroyed.

01:21.600 --> 01:25.052
Destroyed cards go to the Abyss. Tap it to see them.

01:27.800 --> 01:32.350
The AI plays a Club on our Jack, which makes it weaker. We accept it.

01:33.267 --> 01:38.679
Then the AI's King attacks. We have no free Royal to block, so we tap Let through.

01:40.667 --> 01:42.145
We take 3 damage.

01:43.067 --> 01:46.163
Our turn. We put another Diamond into the Mine.

01:52.867 --> 01:54.805
Our energy is now 17.

01:55.733 --> 01:57.054
Our Jack attacks.

02:00.733 --> 02:04.181
The AI does not block, so it loses 5 health.

02:05.733 --> 02:11.046
Clubs also deal damage. We play the 9 of Clubs, then tap the AI's name.

02:13.033 --> 02:14.943
The AI drops to 6 health.

02:15.867 --> 02:19.356
On its turn, the AI hits us with the 7 of Clubs.

02:20.267 --> 02:25.208
Then it heals itself with a Heart, and its King attacks. We are down to 7.

02:26.667 --> 02:32.129
Our turn. Hearts heal. We pick the 7 of Hearts, then tap our own name.

02:34.467 --> 02:36.660
We go back up to 14 health.

02:37.567 --> 02:39.414
We attack with our Jack again.

02:46.867 --> 02:50.266
The AI does not block. It is down to 9 health.

02:51.167 --> 02:54.072
Next, we play the 4 of Clubs on the AI.

02:58.467 --> 03:00.202
It drops to 5 health.

03:01.133 --> 03:06.179
The AI adds a Spade to its King, which now has 10 attack. Then the King attacks.

03:08.133 --> 03:09.588
We take 10 damage.

03:10.500 --> 03:14.551
Our turn. We pick the 6 of Hearts and tap our own name again.

03:19.800 --> 03:25.326
We go back up to 10 health. This time we keep our Jack home, so it can block.

03:26.233 --> 03:30.097
The AI's King attacks again. We choose our Jack to block it.

03:32.133 --> 03:40.594
A duel begins. The King has 10 attack, and our Jack only 5. In a duel, both players can play cards to change the result.

03:41.500 --> 03:46.189
We play the 8 of Spades on our Jack. That gives it 8 more attack and defense.

03:47.100 --> 03:53.228
Our Jack now has 13 attack against 10, so it wins the duel. The AI's King is destroyed.

03:54.133 --> 03:57.653
The AI has no Royals left. We attack with our Jack.

03:58.567 --> 04:02.721
13 damage. The AI's health reaches zero. We win!

04:03.633 --> 04:08.648
Victory! Now it is your turn. Command the arcane, and claim the throne.
